  "steps": [
    "Heat a non-stick pan. Sprinkle grated mozzarella and low-fat paneer in a square shape.",
    "Arrange the zucchini slices on top of it, slightly overlapping.",
    "Then add another thin layer of cheese and paneer on top.",
    "Cook until the bottom is golden brown and crispy, then carefully flip and cook the other side.",
    "Let both zucchini slices cool for a few minutes so they become firm before assembling.",
    "Spread ½ tbsp green chutney on one slice, then layer the aloo masala, cucumber, onion, tomato, and beetroot.",
    "Place the second zucchini slice on top.",
    "Please wrap it up and then cut the sandwich into slices or the fillings will explode.",
    "Top with sev if feeling fancy."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The aloo masala filling is optional."
